\\ test/capture_macros.6502 - the capture check's macros.

\\ A line (make_line's) into a pair of Fletcher sums: its columns and side, then its rows if it has
\\ columns.
\\
\\ Inputs:
\\     line_x0 to line_below: the line
\\     s1, s2: the sums
\\
\\ Outputs:
\\     s1, s2: the line added
\\     A: corrupted

MACRO LINE_SUMS s1, s2
    LDA line_x0:FLETCHER s1, s2
    LDA line_x1:FLETCHER s1, s2
    LDA line_below:FLETCHER s1, s2
    LDA line_x0:CMP line_x1:BCS done    ; no columns
    FOR v = {line_y, line_y+1, line_grad, line_grad+1, line_endy}
        LDA v:FLETCHER s1, s2
    NEXT
.done
ENDMACRO
